What the app installs on request (NOT shipped with it)

Neither of the two items below is in this repository or in the app's own zip. The app
downloads them only when the user presses Install / Repair / Update (never automatically),
from the addresses written in src\AppInfo.cs, and puts them into the mod's own copy of the
game (never into the Steam copy).

BepInEx 6.0.0-be.735 (BepInEx-Unity.IL2CPP-win-x86-6.0.0-be.735+5fef357.zip)
Licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 (LGPL-2.1).
Source and licence text: https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx
Downloaded from: https://builds.bepinex.dev/projects/bepinex_be/735/
The app checks the zip's SHA-256 against the value written in src\AppInfo.cs before it
unpacks anything (docs\BEPINEX-PIN.md).

